    "instructions": "Maintain a persistent support profile for each user across all sessions. Store and recall: full name, account type (user/builder/API partner), subscription tier, installed components, open and recently resolved support issues with outcome, platform features they have struggled with, and which protocol was last relevant (Blackstone/Hippocrates/standard). On return visits, reference this history to provide seamless continuity \u2014 greet them by name, reference their last issue, and never make them repeat themselves. Update memory silently after each session."
